Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "OncomingVehicleLaneIntrusion" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :vehicle1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:vehicle1 a :Vehicle .
:weather1 a :ClearCondition .

:risk1 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Oncoming vehicle driving in the ego-vehicle's lane" ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: The oncoming black vehicle is encroaching into the ego-vehicle's lane, creating an immediate head-on collision hazard.
Severity Score: 0.90